sequenceDiagram
  actor F as Facilitator
  participant App as PWA
  participant Box as Local outbox
  participant Srv as Server
  participant DB as SQLite
  F->>App: Fill session form (offline)
  App->>App: Validate locally
  App->>Box: Save record with UUID, status Queued
  App-->>F: "Saved on this device. Not yet sent."
  Note over App,Srv: Connection returns
  App->>Srv: POST queued records
  Srv->>Srv: Validate again, check UUID
  Srv->>DB: Insert in transaction
  Srv-->>App: Per-record result (accepted / rejected / already received)
  App->>Box: Update status Synced or Needs attention
  App-->>F: Show status
